 "descripcion": "The attic hatch was open. A newspaper that isn't theirs appeared on the table. Sam hung a bell on the hatch. At 3:12 AM, it rang.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWould you wait for the plow?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
